I can't even breathe, under the pressure of information...

21
00:09:46,644 --> 00:09:51,344
めまいの螺旋だ わたしはどこにいる
In a spiral of dizziness... Where am I?

22
00:09:51,444 --> 00:09:57,344
こんなに こんなに 息の音がするのに 変だね
Even though I can hear the sound of my breathing so clearly, it's strange...

23
00:09:59,044 --> 00:10:02,944
世界の音がしない
The sound of the world is gone.

24
00:10:01,876 --> 00:10:05,976
足りない 足りない 誰にも気づかれない
Not enough, not enough, no one even notices...

25
00:10:06,196 --> 00:10:09,856
殴り書きみたいな音
Sounds like scribbled-out notes,

26
00:10:09,856 --> 00:10:12,176
出せない状態で叫んだよ
I screamed them out with no way to send them.

27
00:10:12,536 --> 00:10:17,016
「ありのまま」なんて誰に見せるんだ
Who could ever show their true self to anyone?

28
00:10:18,076 --> 00:10:22,076
馬鹿なわたしは歌うだけ
Stupid me, all I can do is sing.

29
00:10:22,676 --> 00:10:25,556
ぶちまけちゃおうか 星に
Shall I spill it all out to the stars?

30
00:10:36,916 --> 00:10:42,016
エリクサーに張り替える作業もなんとなくなんだ
Changing the strings to elixir feels sort of aimless, too.

31
