欠けた爪を少し触る
I lightly touch my chipped nail.

32
00:10:46,616 --> 00:10:52,116
半径300mmの体で必死に鳴いてる
With this body of a 300mm radius, I'm crying out for all I'm worth.

33
00:10:52,616 --> 00:10:56,816
音楽にとっちゃ ココが地球だな
As far as music goes, this place is Earth.

34
00:10:57,116 --> 00:11:01,416
空気を握って 空を殴るよ
I'll grab the air and punch the sky!

35
