00:27:26,105 --> 00:27:29,345
狂おしいほど思い残す 遠い日の無力さを呪う
Cursing the lingering, maddening regrets and the helplessness of distant days.

136
00:27:29,425 --> 00:27:31,845
身を焼かれるような絶望も糧にはなろうか
Perhaps even soul-scorching despair can become nourishment.

137
00:27:32,085 --> 00:27:35,025
キラキラお星様宿したあなたの eyes
Your eyes, harboring glittering stars,

138
00:27:35,125 --> 00:27:37,885
カラカラ渇いて可哀想な lack of 愛？
Parched and dry, pitiful lack of love?

139
00:27:37,885 --> 00:27:40,705
全てを孤独から救う眩しい光
A dazzling light saving everything from solitude.

140
00:27:40,705 --> 00:27:44,685
僕にだけ落ちる影はあなたのせい？
Is the shadow falling only on me your fault?

141
00:27:44,785 --> 00:27:49,485
致命的な欠落をくれたね 身勝手な巨星 狂わされた生
You gave me a fatal flaw. A selfish giant star, a life driven mad.

142
00:27:50,185 --> 00:27:55,605
お願い 声を聞かせて 声を聞かせて 絡まって歪んでしまった傷さえ
Please, let me hear your voice, let me hear your voice. Even these entangled, distorted wounds...

143
00:27:56,025 --> 00:27:59,345
くれたのはあなただけ あなただけ
...were given to me by you alone, only you.

144
00:27:59,705 --> 00:28:02,185
ああ あなただけ あなただけ
(Ah, only you, only you)

145
00:28:02,185 --> 00:28:06,085
お願い 僕を見ていて 僕を見ていて
Please, keep looking at me, keep looking at me.

146
00:28:06,365 --> 00:28:13,505
宿命に刻まれた痛みさえ武器にして いつかの後悔すら照らせるように
Turning even the pain carved into our fate into a weapon, so we can illuminate even past regrets.

147
00:28:14,965 --> 00:28:20,385
あなたがいないと生きていけない 何もかも捧げてしまってもいい
I cannot live without you. I wouldn't even mind sacrificing everything.

148
00:28:20,485 --> 00:28:26,625
あなたの愛がまだ足らない 欠けたものは何で埋めたらいい？
Your love is still not enough. What should I use to fill what's missing?

149
00:28:26,845 --> 00:28:32,785
致命的 致命的 致命的な愛 運命的 運命的 運命的なI
Fatal, fatal, fatal love! Fateful, fateful, fateful I!

150
00:28:33,165 --> 00:28:36,445
必然的 必然的 必然的な哀
Inevitable, inevitable, inevitable sorrow!

151
00:28:36,445 --> 00:28:39,485
僕を見ていてね 最愛のファタール！
Look at me, my dearest fatal!

152
00:28:51,645 --> 00:28:54,565
キラキラお星様宿したあなたの eyes
Your eyes, harboring glittering stars,

153
00:28:54,645 --> 00:28:57,565
カラカラ渇いて可哀想な lack of 愛？
Parched and dry, pitiful lack of love?

154
00:28:57,665 --> 00:29:03,785
遥か彼方から放たれた美しさに 灼かれた眼 もがれた羽根 創造的堕天
To the beauty released from afar: scorched eyes, torn wings, creative fall from grace.

155
00:29:04,445 --> 00:29:07,425
あらゆる視界をジャック その輝きはエゴイスティック
Jacking all fields of vision, that brilliance is egotistical.

156
00:29:07,425 --> 00:29:10,885
胸の奥仕舞った感情さえ 引っ張り出して昇華して
Pulling out and sublimating even the emotions tucked deep within my chest.

157
00:29:11,125 --> 00:29:15,485
僕という運命を全部抱きしめていく
Embracing my entire destiny completely.

158
00:29:16,265 --> 00:29:21,865
あなたがいないと生きていけない 眩しさでこの身を照らして欲しい
I cannot live without you. I want you to illuminate this body with your dazzling light.

159
00:29:21,985 --> 00:29:28,065
あなたの愛がまだ足らない 夢の中でもらうしかないのに
Your love is still not enough, even though I have no choice but to receive it within dreams.

160
00:29:28,305 --> 00:29:34,185
致命的 致命的 致命的な愛 運命的 運命的 運命的なI
Fatal, fatal, fatal love! Fateful, fateful, fateful I!

161
00:29:34,545 --> 00:29:37,785
必然的 必然的 必然的な哀
Inevitable, inevitable, inevitable sorrow!

162
00:29:37,785 --> 00:29:41,525
誰のものでもない 最愛のファタール！
Belonging to no one, my dearest fatal!

163
00:29:42,045 --> 00:29:45,645
何度悔やんだだろう 何度呪っただろう
How many times did I regret? How many times did I curse?

164
00:29:45,845 --> 00:29:52,625
これほどの幸福を注いだとしても 満たされることのない器
Even when pouring this much happiness, a vessel that is never filled.

165
00:29:53,225 --> 00:29:56,845
何度夢見ただろう 何度願っただろう
How many times did I dream? How many times did I wish?

166
00:29:56,965 --> 00:30:01,800
僕の胸で膿み続けている傷を撫でる手を
The hand caressing the wounds that keep festering in my chest...

167
00:30:02,880 --> 00:30:05,190
僕の胸で膿み続けている傷を撫でる手を
...The hand stroking the wound that keeps festering in my chest...

168
00:30:05,980 --> 00:30:08,700
この舞台で足掻くことをやめない
I will never stop struggling on this stage.

169
00:30:08,910 --> 00:30:11,870
ただ一つのアイに近づきたい
I want to draw closer to that one and only love.

170
00:30:12,060 --> 00:30:14,510
固く定まったこの宿命
This destiny is firmly set in stone.

171
00:30:14,650 --> 00:30:17,690
あの星の光からこぼれた闇
The darkness spilling from the starlight—

172
00:30:17,770 --> 00:30:20,820
あなたがいないと生きていけない
I cannot live without you.

173
00:30:20,930 --> 00:30:24,250
何もかも捧げてしまってもいい
It's fine even if I sacrifice everything.

174
00:30:24,360 --> 00:30:27,250
あなたの愛がまだ足らない
Your love is still not enough.

175
00:30:27,360 --> 00:30:30,180
欠けたものは何で埋めたらいい？
What should I use to fill what's missing?

176
00:30:30,360 --> 00:30:33,100
致命的 致命的 致命的な愛
Fatal, fatal, fatal love—

177
00:30:33,100 --> 00:30:36,080
運命的 運命的 運命的なI
Destined, destined, destined I—

178
00:30:36,080 --> 00:30:39,280
必然的 必然的 必然的な哀
Inevitable, inevitable, inevitable sorrow—

179
00:30:39,390 --> 00:30:42,660
僕を見ていてね 最愛のファタール！
Keep watching over me, my dearest fatale!

180
00:31:08,575 --> 00:31:11,275
まるで御伽の話 終わりを迎えた証
It's like a fairy tale, proof that the end has come.

181
00:31:11,675 --> 00:31:17,365
長過ぎる旅路から 切り出した一節
An excerpt carved out from a journey far too long.

182
00:31:17,365 --> 00:31:25,985
それはかつてこの地に 影を落とした悪を 討ち取りし勇者との 短い旅の記憶
It is the memory of a brief journey with the hero who once defeated the evil that cast its shadow upon this land.

183
00:31:37,180 --> 00:31:41,750
物語は終わり 勇者は眠りにつく
The story is over, the hero falls into slumber.

184
00:31:41,870 --> 00:31:46,670
穏やかな日常を この地に残して
Leaving peaceful everyday life behind in this land.

185
00:31:46,780 --> 00:31:55,170
時の流れは無情に 人を忘れさせる そこに生きた軌跡も 錆び付いていく
The passage of time ruthlessly makes people forget, and even the traces of life lived there begin to rust away.

186
00:31:55,680 --> 00:32:04,130
それでも君の 言葉も願いも勇気も 今も確かに私の中で 生きている
And yet, your words, your wishes, and your courage still live on inside me sure and clear.

187
00:32:05,340 --> 00:32:08,660
同じ途を選んだ それだけだったはずなのに
Even though it should have been just choosing the same path—

188
00:32:08,660 --> 00:32:15,200
いつの間にかどうして 頬を伝う涙の理由をもっと知りたいんだ
Before I knew it, why? I want to know more about the reason behind the tears streaming down my cheeks.

189
00:32:15,820 --> 00:32:20,060
今更だって 共に歩んだ旅路を辿れば
If I retrace the journey we walked together, though it's late—

190
00:32:20,170 --> 00:32:25,140
そこに君は居なくとも きっと見つけられる
Even if you are no longer there, I'm sure I can find it.

191
00:32:34,950 --> 00:32:39,410
物語は続く 一人の旅へと発つ
The story continues, setting off on a journey alone.

192
00:32:39,540 --> 00:32:43,560
立ち寄る街で出会う 人の記憶の中に残る君は
You, remaining in the memories of the people met in the towns I stop by—

193
00:32:43,770 --> 00:32:48,090
相も変わらずお人好しで 格好つけてばかりだね
You're still as good-natured and trying to look cool as ever.

194
00:32:48,450 --> 00:32:52,820
あちらこちらに作ったシンボルは 勝ち取った平和の証
The symbols created here and there are proof of the peace won.

195
00:32:52,950 --> 00:33:00,960
それすら未来でいつか 私が一人にならないように あの旅を思い出せるように 残された目印
Even those are markers left behind so that someday in the future I won't be alone, so that I can remember that journey.

196
00:33:11,870 --> 00:33:18,660
まるで御伽の話 終わりを迎えた証 私を変えた出会い 百分の一の旅路
It's like a fairy tale, proof that the end has come. An encounter that changed me, a journey of one-in-a-hundred.

197
00:33:21,750 --> 00:33:31,180
君の勇気をいつか風がさらって 誰の記憶から消えてしまっても 私が未来に連れて行くから 君の手を取った
Even if the wind someday carries away your courage and it fades from everyone's memory, I will take it with me into the future—I took your hand.

198
00:33:32,770 --> 00:33:42,920
あの日全て始まった くだらなくて思わずふっと笑ってしまうような ありふれた時間が 今も眩しい 知りたいんだ
Where it all started on that day—commonplace times so foolish they make me involuntarily chuckle are still dazzling now. I want to know.

199
00:33:42,920 --> 00:33:52,030
今更だって振り返るとそこにはいつでも 優しく微笑みかける君がいるから
Looking back even now, because you are always there smiling gently.

200
00:34:29,295 --> 00:34:33,045
勇者、いい曲だったね。
"Yusha" was such a great song.

201
00:34:33,485 --> 00:34:39,185
VJとかもね、あっVJっていうのはこの後ろのMVのことなんだけど。
And the VJ stuff too—ah, by VJ, I mean the music video in the back.

202
00:34:39,185 --> 00:34:45,255
VJとかもね、こだわって見たので、えーぜひぜひいっぱい見てもらいたいな。
We put a lot of care into the VJ and visuals, so I hope you all check it out a lot.

203
00:34:45,255 --> 00:34:48,115
アーカイブとかもね、あ、まだ貼ってないけどね。
The archive too—ah, it's not up yet though.

204
00:34:48,115 --> 00:34:52,475
ゲストさんもいっぱい来てくれて嬉しいよ！ありがとう！
I'm so happy so many guests came! Thank you so much!

205
00:34:52,475 --> 00:34:59,945
なんかさ、いままでのセトリさ、あの平成の
You know, the setlist so far... um, Heisei era...

206
00:35:00,272 --> 00:35:04,312
ほんとか、ま、令和のアニソンとかも盛り込んでみたんだけど、
I packed in some Showa and even Reiwa anisongs...

207
00:35:04,312 --> 00:35:06,992
知ってる曲はありましたか？
Were there any songs you knew?

208
00:35:06,992 --> 00:35:10,052
お気に入りの曲とかあったかな？
Did you find any favorite songs?

209
00:35:10,052 --> 00:35:18,372
なんか好きな曲とかもし見つかったりしたら教えてほしいなと思います。この曲よかったよとか教えてください。
If you found any songs you liked, I'd love for you to tell me. Let me know if you thought a certain song was great.

210
00:35:18,372 --> 00:35:23,772
あ、今コメントで教えてくれてもいいんだよ。
Ah, you can tell me in the chat right now, too.

211
00:35:23,772 --> 00:35:29,352
でも、これで終わりじゃないんだよね！1曲だけ、ま、この後
But, you know, this isn't the end yet! Just one more song... well, after this...

212
00:35:29,352 --> 00:35:43,212
ちょっとゲームの曲とかもなんかあんまざてんだけど、あのコンセプトがある、セットリストになってます、この後探してもらえると嬉しいです。
There are also some game songs mixed in, but the setlist has a specific concept, so I'd be happy if you look for it after this.

213
00:35:43,212 --> 00:35:51,792
ゲストさんもね、まだ出ていない人もいるので、楽しみににしててください。はーい！よーし！
And there are still guest participants who haven't appeared yet, so please look forward to it. Yay! All right!

214
00:35:51,792 --> 00:35:56,992
では、聞いてください。
Now, please listen.

215
00:36:05,286 --> 00:36:14,526
止まらない未来を目指して
Aiming for an unstoppable future,

216
00:36:15,286 --> 00:36:28,146
ゆずれない願いを抱きしめて
holding fast to an unyielding wish...

217
00:36:36,702 --> 00:36:41,442
海の色が紅く染まってく
The color of the sea is dyed red,

218
00:36:41,442 --> 00:36:43,852
無重力状態
in a state of zero gravity.

219
00:36:43,852 --> 00:36:48,472
このまま風にさらわれたい
I want to be carried away by the wind just like this.

220
00:36:48,472 --> 00:36:57,312
いつも跳べないハードルを負けない気持ちでクリアしてきたけど
I've always cleared impossible hurdles with an unyielding spirit, but...

221
00:36:57,312 --> 00:37:01,512
出し切れない実力は
this inability to give it my all...

222
00:37:01,512 --> 00:37:06,292
誰のせい？
whose fault is it?

223
00:37:06,992 --> 00:37:13,392
止まらない未来を目指して
Aiming for an unstoppable future,

224
00:37:14,052 --> 00:37:22,452
ゆずれない願いを抱きしめて色褪せない心の地図
holding fast to an unyielding wish, with an unfading map of the heart...

225
00:37:22,452 --> 00:37:27,672
光にかざそう
let's hold it up to the light!

226
00:37:34,372 --> 00:37:38,792
どれだけ泣けば朝に出逢えるの
How much must I cry before I meet the morning?

227
00:37:38,792 --> 00:37:46,572
孤独な夜初めて限界を感じた日
On that lonely night, the first day I felt my limits,

228
00:37:47,132 --> 00:37:55,892
きっと恋に落ちるのはまばたきみたいな一瞬の情熱だけど
surely falling in love is a momentary passion in the blink of an eye, but...

229
00:37:55,892 --> 00:38:04,092
愛に続く坂道で強さを覚えたい
on the slope leading to love, I want to learn strength.

230
00:38:04,512 --> 00:38:11,092
止まらない未来を夢見て
Dreaming of an unstoppable future,

231
00:38:11,592 --> 00:38:20,332
口を閉ざし瞳を光らせてきたけれど
I closed my mouth and kept my eyes shining, but...

232
00:38:20,332 --> 00:38:27,692
もっと大きな優しさが見えた
a much greater kindness came into view.

233
00:38:46,132 --> 00:38:53,492
跳べないハードルを負けない気持ちでクリアしてきたけど
I've always cleared impossible hurdles with an unyielding spirit, but...

234
00:38:53,832 --> 00:39:01,592
スタートラインに立つたびに怯えていた
every time I stood at the starting line, I was frightened.

235
00:39:02,272 --> 00:39:08,712
止まらない未来を描いて
Painting an unstoppable future,

236
00:39:09,452 --> 00:39:16,952
腕を伸ばし心を開いて
stretching out my arms and opening my heart,

237
00:39:17,172 --> 00:39:23,852
止まらない未来を目指して
aiming for an unstoppable future,

238
00:39:24,572 --> 00:39:32,632
ゆずれない願いを抱きしめて色褪せない心の地図
holding fast to an unyielding wish, with an unfading map of the heart...

239
00:39:32,632 --> 00:39:38,812
光にかざそう
let's hold it up to the light!

240
00:40:23,997 --> 00:40:34,577
胸にこみ上げてく 熱く 激しい この想い
Rising in my chest... This hot, intense emotion!

241
00:40:35,377 --> 00:40:40,357
僕らは行く 最後の戦場へ
We are heading to the final battlefield...

242
00:40:41,017 --> 00:40:46,537
手を取り合い 誓い合って
Taking each other's hands, making our vows...

243
00:40:48,197 --> 00:40:57,917
明日の夜明け前に あの宇宙へと旅立つのさ
Before tomorrow's dawn, we'll set off to that universe!

244
00:40:58,397 --> 00:41:09,057
僕らが地球にいたことだけ どうか 覚えていて欲しいよ
I hope you'll remember that we were once on Earth.

245
00:41:10,537 --> 00:41:15,277
振り向くな 涙を見せるな
Don't look back, don't show your tears!

246
00:41:15,357 --> 00:41:23,517
I GET THE POWER OF LOVE 明日を取り戻すんだ
I GET THE POWER OF LOVE, to take back tomorrow!

247
00:41:27,197 --> 00:41:30,117
GONG 鳴らせ！！
Ring the GONG!!

248
00:41:30,237 --> 00:41:35,797
今こそ 立ち上がれ 運命の戦士よ
Rise up right now, warriors of destiny!

249
00:41:36,177 --> 00:41:42,077
稲妻の剣で 敵を蹴散らせ
Scatter the enemy with the sword of lightning!

250
00:41:42,637 --> 00:41:52,997
安らぎを夢見る 鋼の勇者よ 守るべき未来と愛を信じて 永遠へ！ 永遠へ！
Steel heroes dreaming of peace, believe in the future and love to protect, into eternity!

251
00:42:14,537 --> 00:42:24,937
もしも 力つきて 闘志の刃砕けても
Even if our strength fails and our fighting spirit's blade shatters...

252
00:42:25,397 --> 00:42:31,437
僕らは二度と戻らない ともに銀河の海に散ろう
We will never return; let us scatter together in the sea of the galaxy!

253
00:42:37,277 --> 00:42:42,057
恐れるな 誇りを捨てるな
Do not fear, do not cast aside your pride!

254
00:42:42,217 --> 00:42:50,457
I GET THE POWER OF LOVE さぁ 迷わず 行くんだ！
I GET THE POWER OF LOVE, now go without hesitation!

255
00:42:55,217 --> 00:42:57,857
GONG 鳴らせ！！
Ring the GONG!!

256
00:42:58,137 --> 00:43:03,137
雄々しく 舞い踊れ 運命の戦士よ
Dance valiantly, warriors of destiny!

257
00:43:03,537 --> 00:43:09,097
金色の翼で 天に羽ばたけ
Spread your wings of gold and take flight to the heavens!

258
00:43:09,617 --> 00:43:20,437
退くことを知らない 鋼の勇者よ 燃えたぎるソウルの命ずるままに 永遠へ！ 永遠へ！
Steel heroes who know no retreat, follow the dictates of your burning souls, into eternity!

259
00:43:28,277 --> 00:43:39,517
WOO WOO WOO...

260
00:44:07,277 --> 00:44:11,257
GONG 鳴らせ！！
Ring the GONG!!

261
00:44:12,297 --> 00:44:17,697
今こそ 立ち上がれ 運命の戦士よ
Rise up right now, warriors of destiny!

262
00:44:18,177 --> 00:44:23,997
稲妻の剣で 敵を蹴散らせ
Scatter the enemy with the sword of lightning!

263
00:44:24,277 --> 00:44:34,617
安らぎを夢見る 鋼の勇者よ 守るべき未来と愛を信じて 永遠へ！ 永遠へ！
Steel heroes dreaming of peace, believe in the future and love to protect, into eternity!

264
00:45:24,046 --> 00:45:28,646
君は聴こえる？僕のこの声が
Can you hear my voice?

265
00:45:29,246 --> 00:45:33,586
闇に虚しく吸い込まれた
Swallowed up emptily into the darkness...

266
00:45:35,146 --> 00:45:44,946
もしも世界が意味を持つなら こんな気持ちも無駄ではない？
If the world has meaning, aren't these feelings useless too?

267
00:45:45,946 --> 00:45:50,566
憧れに押しつぶされて あきらめてたんだ
Crushed by yearning, I had given up...

268
00:45:51,446 --> 00:45:55,446
果てしない空の色も知らないで
Without even knowing the color of the endless sky,

269
00:45:56,446 --> 00:45:58,446
走り出した
I started running out!

270
00:45:59,106 --> 00:46:06,646
想いが今でも この胸を確かに叩いてるから
Because those feelings are still firmly beating in my chest,

271
00:46:08,246 --> 00:46:18,246
今日の僕がその先に続く 僕らなりの明日を築いていく
Today's me continues onward, building our own kind of tomorrow!

272
00:46:19,246 --> 00:46:26,246
